<title>SWEDEN: Sydkraft takes up 7-yr $350 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Sydkraft takes up 7-yr $350 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish electricity company Sydkraft on Thursday said it had taken up a $350 million loan with a group of 20 international banks led by Enskilda Department Capital Markets and Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
</text>
